るが……"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10681","sourceWorkId":"14827","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有能で成績は常に上位をキープしている学生会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒見は良いが、自他共に厳しい性格ゆえ常に孤独を抱えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と並んで周囲の信頼が厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来は快活で天真爛漫な性格なものの、家庭の事情で愛情に飢えており、優しく頼りがいのあるに主人公に憧れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不運にもエルに目をつけられ、図らずも主人公に処女を捧げることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の与える快楽に溺れて、次第に歪んだ快楽に目覚めるが……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「そうよ……わたしは変態なの、これが本当のわたし、わたし悪い子なの！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"51450"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"77 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10681","sourceWorkId":"14827","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10681","sourceWorkId":"14827","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"76 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10681","sourceWorkId":"14827","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"50 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10681","sourceWorkId":"14827","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71a86fc5224e6c90c6d24dca5d16e444770f35fa1e3eea9ae412eff2817c4939.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e0715767171226de26338624f29cc8ce0d991b0254abef7544272dc61a575ca1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"民安ともえ","creatorId":"vndb:s23","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23","name":"民安 ともえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:209553:51450:5900:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34780","characterName":"久我 奏","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"51451",